v0.3.0 - SDC-Bench CLI

New:
- gpu-sentinel CLI with inject, benchmark, list-faults subcommands
- 8 supported fault types covering all shipped detection codes
- --json output for scripted runs and CI integration
- Live SDC-Bench: 100% detection rate, 0 false positives,
  0.5 avg latency steps across all 8 fault types

Implementation:
- gpu_sentinel/inject.py: FaultSpec registry, run_injection,
  run_benchmark, InjectionResult, BenchmarkResult
- gpu_sentinel/cli.py: argparse subcommands with colored output
- pyproject.toml: console_scripts entry registers 'gpu-sentinel'
  command after pip install
